graph LR
    A[App Opened]:::checkpoint --> B{Returning User?}
    B -->|remembered account| WB[Welcome Back]:::grey
    WB -->|one-tap re-auth| WB_AUTH[Sign In]:::grey
    WB_AUTH -->|success| MAIN[Main App]:::grey
    WB -->|not you? sign out| A

    B -->|fresh install| S1[Hero Screen]:::checkpoint
    S1 -->|lets start| S2[Meet Ibu]
    S2 -->|continue| S3[Name Input]:::checkpoint
    S2 -->|already have an account?| S7
    S3 -->|continue| S4[Welcome Celebration]
    S3 -->|skip| S7
    S4 -->|auto-advance 2.8s| S5[Interests Selection]:::checkpoint
    S5 -->|continue| S6[Social Proof]
    S5 -->|skip| S7
    S6 -->|continue| S7[Create Account]:::checkpoint

    S7 -->|apple / google| AUTH_OAUTH{Auth Result}
    S7 -->|email| AUTH_EMAIL[Email Auth Form]
    AUTH_EMAIL -->|submit| AUTH_OAUTH

    AUTH_OAUTH -->|sign up success| S8[Post-Signup Celebration]
    AUTH_OAUTH -->|sign in, existing user| PAYWALL_GATE{Paywall Gate}

    S8 -->|continue| S9[Notification Permission]:::checkpoint
    S9 -->|enable or maybe later| S10[Daily Goal]
    S10 -->|continue| S10B[Age Group]
    S10B -->|continue| S11[Loading]
    S11 -->|auto-advance| S12[Learning Path Overview]:::checkpoint

    S10 -->|skip| S13
    S10B -->|skip| S13

    S12 -->|get started| S13[Soft Paywall]:::checkpoint
    S13 -->|see my free offer| S14[Custom Paywall]:::checkpoint
    S14 -->|subscribe| MAIN2[Main App]:::checkpoint
    S14 -->|dismiss| MAIN2

    PAYWALL_GATE -->|first sign-in, not subscribed| S13
    PAYWALL_GATE -->|already seen or subscribed| MAIN2

    classDef checkpoint fill:#809DE4,stroke:#6580C0,color:#fff
    classDef grey fill:#9ca3af,stroke:#6b7280,color:#fff
    classDef default fill:#fff,stroke:#ccc,color:#333
